            "detailed_description": "Puzzle a shivering jello through 48 levels of a haunted house.<br>But beware! Scary monsters are waiting in the dark! Your only chance of survival is to scare the monsters back before the jello quivers, shivers and faints from fear. Fight evil witches, rattling skeletons and rusty knights with an arsenal of crazy weapons! Collect coins to reload your weapons and valerian for your nerves! Are you clever and skilled enough to escape the labyrinth and to defeat the final enemies?<br>Test your courage in 48 suspenseful levels and dive into four beautiful 3D worlds! Many variations in gameplay and lots of challenges will make your pulse rise and your adrenalin flow: Solve puzzles, play against the clock, escape the monsters and win treacherous<br>races!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    48 levels of different gameplay challenges<br></li><li>    hilarious animations and sounds<br></li><li>    beautiful 3D environments<br></li><li>    suspense, action and puzzling fun!</li></ul>",
